10. An application upgrade caused downtime even though you had rolling updates configured. What advanced strategies would you apply to ensure zero-downtime deployments next time?

Why it happened:

- Readiness probe failures.
- No maxUnavailable/maxSurge tuning.
- Database migrations broke compatibility.

Advanced Strategies:

- Canary/Blue-Green deployments: Use Argo Rollouts/Flagger.
- PreStop hooks: Graceful shutdown.
- PodDisruptionBudgets.
- Readiness gates: Wait for external conditions (e.g., DB schema ready).
- Feature flag toggling to reduce dependency on rollout.
